                                  "text": "SHOWTIMES - FRI, 24/04/26\n\n#GhostinTheCell 2,711 (+7.88%)\n#TibaTibaSetan 1,236 (+19.77%)\n#ParaPerasuk 1,154 (-3.83%)\n#LeeCroninsTheMummy 1,102 (-0.99%)\n#KupiilihJalurLangit 1,089 (-29.88%)\n---\n#AyahIniArahnyaKeManaYa 990 (-29.88%)\n#MotherMary 668 (opening)\n#Michael 526 (-35.38%)\n#Songko 446 (-16.95%)\n#ProjectHailMary 340 (-8.36%)\n#TheDrama 223 (-31.80%)\n#ReadyorNot2 117 (-7.14%)\n#DanurTLC 81 (-62.00%)\n#TheSuperMarioGalaxyMovie 60 (-27.71%)\n#NaWilla 49 (-10.91%)"
                                }
